/**
 * DELPHI QUALIA — complete mainframe (478 entries, 24 systems, 8 axes).
 * Generated from master.py + complete.py + decks.py + pass_a.py. Do not hand-edit.
 *
 * Axes (−1..+1): active·rising·steady·warm·outward·binding·gentle·light
 * nature: computed→HOME | birth→YOU | cast→drawn only
 * tier:   measured (the official claim — real astronomy/math)
 *       | celebrated (an enthusiastic honoring of how a culture read the sky)
 * honesty: render | foreground | acknowledge
 *
 * TIER IS THE LEGITIMACY SPINE. The app must always show it at the point of
 * reading: `measured` entries are what Delphi calculates and stakes precision on;
 * `celebrated` entries are humanity's worldwide, millennia-long practice of
 * looking up for meaning — offered with respect, never as official representation.
 *
 * Sub-day systems (planetary-hour, chinese-shi, muhurta) are quality-bearing and
 * shift through the day. Numerology reads the moment's reduced numbers.
 * Cast decks full-fidelity: tarot 78, iching 64, runes 24, orisha 8 (boundary).
 */

